Where a session starts
06-administrator-commands
Chooses what you see when you sign on: the home screen (menu), or the ordinary command prompt (terminal). It is menu as delivered. Type menu or home at the prompt to open the home screen from there.
It confines nobody on its own. The Terminal tile on the home screen still gives the command prompt unless you turn that tile off.
The change reaches you at the next sign-on. The command it runs is set.start.default with menu or terminal.
